Allow repository cloning to wait until pod startup

Add build.workspaceClone in .rumpelpod.json so prepared images can skip
transferring the host Git directory to the builder. Local cloning
remains the default, and skip mode reuses checkouts from the base image.

Initialize missing repositories and configure remotes and commit hooks
at startup. Pass these settings with the startup request and inherit
them from the source pod when forking. Keep clone mode in the prepared
image cache key so changing it takes effect.
